  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com/data/6uJCfiCH/0b4983e0ba8cac6ffe2cc5c2076a8a6b0b28fd1f.png\" alt=\"Spooklementary_logo\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Spooklementary</h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&amp;label=加入&amp;labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris, optifine, oculus | 1.7.10 至最新版-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=支援&amp;labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;color=rgb(210, 106, 6)\">\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=rgb(210, 106, 6)&amp;label=贊助&amp;labelColor=rgb(4, 11, 20)&amp;color=rgb(210, 106, 6)&amp;link=https://patreon.com/spaceagle17\">\n</a></p><h2>什麼是 Spooklementary？</h2><ul>\n<li>Spooklementary，由 SpacEagle17 製作，是基於 EminGT 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a> 修改而來。</li>\n<li>這是一款恐怖主題的著色器包，能將你的遊戲轉變為充滿陰鬱與詭譎氛圍的體驗。</li>\n<li>非常適合萬聖節或恐怖地圖！點擊頁面上方的「畫廊」查看截圖。</li>\n</ul><p><strong>重要提醒：請不要將使用此附加元件時遇到的任何錯誤回報給 Emin，而是透過 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 回報給我。</strong></p><h2>連結</h2><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f94a4d0b4854a694e1b3dbb5aa8e42fc15bce89.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n    <br><br>\n  </a>\n</div><ul>\n<li>SpacEagle17 的 <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Discord</ins></a></strong> 伺服器，供討論、提問、建議等用途。</li>\n<li>在 <strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Twitter/X</ins></a></strong> 上追蹤 SpacEagle17，獲取著色器包的最新消息。</li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:655px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CndrX1R5boQ\" width=\"455\" height=\"384\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></div><h2>由 Ember Host 贊助</h2><p>正在尋找平價且可靠的 Minecraft 伺服器主機嗎？Ember Host 提供超值的方案與頂級支援！</p><p>點擊橫幅或在結帳時使用代碼 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong>，即可享有首次購買 <strong>10%</strong> 折扣。此外，您的購買金額中 <strong>70%</strong> 將用於贊助 Euphoria Patches！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/545bcc6a4800cae3bace3a58a06e0dab9eccf9e4_0.webp\"></a></p>",
